What the patch buys
-------------------
`Tools/ShippingChecksP1.lean` (in this branch, written AGAINST THE PATCHED
definitions — it does not build before the patch):

    theorem checkedOptimize_instNames_nodup (hb : hierBinds b = true)
        (hnd : (instNames b.body).Nodup) :
        (instNames (checkedOptimize b).body).Nodup

i.e. conjunct 5 of `textCheckI` and the `ndO` conjunct of `hierCheck`
become consequences of the run fact on `b`, for every run.
